This extension adds RoboCop Rogue City and Unfinished Business modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "Game" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".lua" extension and a file with the ".pak" extension.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "LogicMods" folder to the "Game\Content\Paks\LogicMods\LogicMods" folder.[/*]
[*]Unfinishedbusiness Logicmods mods are recognised by the Unfinishedbusiness Logicmods installer.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "'.pak" file to the "Game\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "'.pak" file to the "Game\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "dwmapi.dll" file.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "dwmapi.dll".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".lua" extension.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".dll" extension.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a top-level folder such as "Game" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Unfinishedbusiness Root mods are recognised by the Unfinishedbusiness Root installer.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "Content" to the "Game" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "Content".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named one of: "engine.ini", "game.ini", "gameusersettings.ini", "input.ini", "scalability.ini", "hardware.ini", "deviceprofiles.ini", "compat.ini", "runtimeoptions.ini", "gameplaytags.ini", "enhancedinput.ini" or "consolevariables.ini".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".sav" file.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".sav" extension.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with anything unrecognised with no pak file.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".pak" extension.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

